			<p class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-primary mb-1">
				<span class="text-accent">R</span>amón Rivera
			</p>
			<p class="text-muted text-xs sm:text-sm">Full Stack Developer · .NET · Angular · Hermosillo, Sonora</p>
		</div>
		<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 sm:gap-10 w-full sm:w-auto">
			<div>
				<p class="text-xs text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Contacto</p>
